    {
      "name": "a-standalone-entry-answers-where-its-saves-refuse",
      "rationale": "The deliberate asymmetry, one family over: a standalone emulator's mod directory is its own default below an XDG base the distribution's flatpak pins, so the entry answers it while refusing savefile_location — with emulator-config-unread naming the file that would say whether loading is on.",
      "input": {
